          "_name": "image2",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image2\" group=\"Images & Videos\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Description\" name=\"showDescription\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/image2096-1036x1382.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-description mbr-fonts-style mt-2 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n                        Image Description</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg' : !fullWidth, 'col-lg-4' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth >= 6, 'col-lg-6' : fullWidth &amp;&amp; textWidth <= 5}\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Dashboard Design</b></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">The dashboard was designed to function as a strategic control center for partners. The goal was to provide clarity, encourage growth, and enable informed decision-making within a single, flexible interface.<br><br><b>Concise &amp; Customizable Overview of Key Metrics</b><br>Partners operate in a performance-driven environment. However, the legacy system required them to navigate across multiple sections to piece together their earnings and network data. To address this, I designed a consolidated dashboard that presents critical information at a glance, like total rebates earned, withdrawal history, number of active sub-partners and trading activity, etc. The interface was fully customizable, allowing users to prioritize and rearrange widgets based on their individual goals.<br><b><br>Motivational Experience with Visual Progress &amp; Nudges</b><br>Beyond clarity, the dashboard was intentionally designed to drive engagement and growth. Partners could view a visual representation of earnings trends over time, track their current rebate tier and understand what actions were required to reach the next level. By making progress visible, the experience shifted from passive reporting to active motivation. Instead of merely showing current status, the system highlighted opportunities for advancement reinforcing growth behaviors.<br><br><b>Marketing Performance Monitoring &amp; Planning Tools</b><br>Since partners essentially act as independent marketers, it was critical to provide visibility into the effectiveness of their acquisition strategies. The dashboard enabled users to analyze the distribution of incoming clients and identify which acquisition channels or strategies were performing best.<br><br>To further support planning, I introduced a rebate calculator tool. This allowed partners to simulate potential earnings based on number of active clients, trading volume and asset categories. This feature transformed the portal from a tracking tool into a strategic planning assistant helping partners make data-informed decisions about where to invest their marketing efforts.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "image2-4m",
          "_cid": "voO9vPDHLH",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
